                            <td width="451" valign="top" height="149">
                              <font face="Arial" color="#000000" size="2"><b>Best
                              rates in the market, and we can exchange the same day...</b></font>
                          <p><font face="Arial" color="#000000" size="2">People
                          come to us for many reasons - financial difficulties,
                          repossession, and bankruptcy are just a few of
                          them.&nbsp;What they all have in common is the need to
                          trust someone who will give them the best return
                          financially and act fast. Property Rescue has been
                          providing sell and rent back services for many years
                          and has the know-how and support to do just that. If
