                            <td width="451" valign="top" height="149">
                              <p align="left"><font face="Arial" size="2"><b>You
                              get a great deal from Property Rescue...</b></font></p>
                              <p align="left"><font face="Arial" size="2">We
                              will make you an offer free of charge and without
                              any obligation. We will offer you between 75% and
                              85% of the open market value of your property
                              (which could take 12-16 weeks or more for you to
                              achieve through estate agents) in return for an
                              express cash completion. Once accepted the money
                              can be in your account within days - no estate agents
                              fees, no viewings, no &quot;for sale&quot; boards and no hassle.&nbsp;</font></td>
